ull,[true,false],null,1],[\"0185bf6b-ae83-421e-8b02-0848bc5d316b\",[\"mooska TAM\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHO3i_8zqmB_vyJqopM07wGmu8ZEznpv8ZECR2WnK6znGN_zdz\"]]],1,null,\"非常易鎖死，原因在“用戶名稱“，我登入用錯了真名，改用登入名稱又用錯了大/小階，用忘記功能搞一輪後，官方給我用戶名稱全是大階的，我堅信不疑改全大階登入，點知就未對過，戶口被鎖死，要去排一個鐘隊解鎖！職員同我核對用戶名稱時，竟清楚指出全是小階！！大佬呀，我被官方告知是大階！點會啱呢，真的大整蠱！今次登入出事我當然有錯，但不想別人受同樣的苦，希望app登入名不要用“用戶名稱“，好易誤會，改用登入名稱易明D，發回用戶的名就不要一律用大階，誤導用戶！\",[1771654236,843000000],16,null,null,[\"111151141568991115014\",\"mooska TAM\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHO3i_8zqmB_vyJqopM07wGmu8ZEznpv8ZECR2WnK6znGN_zdz\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.4.3\",null,[[[\"vaf_never_display_ease_of_use\",null,[3]],[\"vaf_never_display_ads_experience\",null,[3]]]],null,[true,false],null,1],[\"8b65e212-4b0c-4f7b-8555-fcf32535ad39\",[\"CHAN BENNY\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJdLTeMflKADTvjEsFgjUBLvqxw9AOfBwQ5JP5zu9vSEHJUw\\u003dmo\"]]],3,null,\"不知所謂，愈來愈糊塗，辛苦了一班勤奮的同事。你們這些領高薪的大春袋，無能又欠活力。唉！\",[1771574423,121000000],0,null,null,[\"103367714784786959184\",\"CHAN BENNY\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJdLTeMflKADTvjEsFgjUBLvqxw9AOfBwQ5JP5zu9vSEHJUw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.4.3\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"dbbfb317-240b-45b1-a5cf-6b0bc18826cb\",[\"Tong Po Ki\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzvJzcFQwc0O5VDsKPe4HSU8cQMa_P9P29pLMd_F7R9u_nCpzW\"]]],5,null,\"好用，方便\",[1771566413,73000000],0,null,null,[\"105131492738878057259\",\"Tong Po Ki\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzvJzcFQwc0O5VDsKPe4HSU8c